{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1729075681_870173_55fb34ac2e921cdaabb428d0f8b7ba64.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 135, 135); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">The origin of LINKChef&reg; is simple&mdash;it's all about linking understanding and love.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">[LINKChef RushClear Slow Juicer] -&nbsp;<br>Our founder Jason.L grew up in a family known for top-notch kitchen appliances. After graduating in structural design, Jason took charge of developing the juicer line within the main factory's consumer linkage program, leading to a clash with his father. His father wanted to avoid \"quick\" features to preserve juice quality, while Jason believed modern life needed convenience and new technology. Despite their differences, Jason&rsquo;s father continued to personally make fresh juice at every family gathering, even though he was busy and not a skilled cook.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">A heated argument at a family gathering revealed the divide. Jason watched his father meticulously clean the juicer&rsquo;s fine mesh screen and criticized his obsession with details. His father explained that this fine mesh was crucial for purity, and thorough cleaning prevented mold and odors. This moment made Jason realize he hadn&rsquo;t fully understood his father&rsquo;s dedication.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Determined to bridge the gap, Jason began collaborating with his father on slow juicers. They focused on perfecting every detail&mdash;preparing ingredients, choosing the right filters, adjusting speeds, and controlling pulp dryness. Jason discovered the joy of meticulous craftsmanship and the satisfaction of refinement.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Realizing that true innovation combines tradition with modern needs, Jason proposed a redesign to tackle cleaning issues while preserving juice quality. With family resources, he developed the&nbsp;Rush Clear&trade;&nbsp;series&mdash;an advanced juicer that balances efficiency with easy maintenance.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(135, 135, 135); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Jason and his father chose the name \"LINKChef\" because they believed understanding and love link diverse ideas together, uniting their commitment to health with the convenience of innovation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: var(--heading-color); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(168, 193, 63);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px;\">Effortless Juicing with Self-Feed Convenience</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(105, 105, 105); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\">Imagine effortlessly starting your day with a fresh, delicious juice without the hassle of chopping and prepping. The LINKChef Self-Feed Juicer's generous 4.35-inch feed chute and 42oz capacity let you drop whole fruits and vegetables straight in, making your mornings smoother and your juices fresher.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: var(--heading-color); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(168, 193, 63);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px;\">Instant Cleanup for Busy Lives</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(105, 105, 105); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\">With our innovative all-in-one, non-clogging filter that cleans in just 3 seconds, you'll have more time to savor your juice and less time scrubbing with our Rush Clear&trade; cold press juicer.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: var(--heading-color); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(168, 193, 63);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px;\">Simplified Assembly in Three Easy Steps</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(105, 105, 105); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\">Setting up your juicer shouldn&rsquo;t feel like a puzzle. Our one-piece strainer and auger make assembly a breeze, so you can go from box to juice in no time. It&rsquo;s as simple as 1-2-3, giving you more moments to enjoy the things you love.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: var(--heading-color); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(168, 193, 63);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px;\">Generous Juice Yield for the Whole Family</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(105, 105, 105); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\">Think of a single juicing session that yields up to 64oz (8 cups) of fresh juice. Perfect for family breakfasts, gatherings, or just keeping your fridge stocked with your favorite blends. It&rsquo;s your one-stop solution for delicious, nutritious drinks.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: var(--heading-color); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(168, 193, 63);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px;\">Pure Nutrition with Every Sip</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(105, 105, 105); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\">Slow-speed cold-pressing at 45RPM ensures every drop of juice retains its full nutritional value. You&rsquo;re not just drinking juice; you&rsquo;re savoring every nutrient-packed sip as if you picked the produce straight from the garden.</p>\r\n<h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: var(--heading-color); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px; color: rgb(168, 193, 63);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 18px;\">Safety First with Smart Lock Design</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(105, 105, 105); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 248);\">Your safety is our priority. The juicer&rsquo;s smart lock design stops the machine if you open the feed chute cover, giving you peace of mind while you juice. No more worrying about accidental spills or unsafe operation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms: 3% commision amount<br><br>For future collaboration, please contact us via marketing@linkchefkitchen.com&nbsp;</p>",
